      ":question/problem": "![](images/33/33e48fa5bdbb034bcf489e038ccf80fc5f67baabeccacc1b7abd741183ebf05d.png)\n\nConsider the square region $\u0394$ and its **directed** boundary $\u2202\u0394$ in the $uv$-plane, where $\u0394$ is given by\n\n$$\n\u0394=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1\\},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=v,\\,y=u-{v}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThe image of the side ${S}_{3}$ under the action of $T$ is a **directed** line segment. Find the endpoints of this segment, stated in the order that they are traversed."
